---
title: "Swing district incumbents facing tough challenges"
subtitle: "A look at the four most competitive state legislative races"
description: |
  In addition we provide forecasts for all 57 contested Massachusetts State
  Representative and State Senate races on the November 3, 2026 ballot.
author: Brent Benson
date: 2026-10-29
